src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1313:front.shopping.credit_3ds.modal.body: |
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1314:  We have introduced 3-D Secure 2.0, which authenticates the identity of the customer for credit card payment, to provide our customers with a safer and more secure shopping experience.<br>
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1315:  This enables strict identity authentication, preventing third parties from stealing credit card information or impersonating the cardholder, and allowing customers to make credit card payments with safety.<br><br>
src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:1317:  The 3-D Secure 2.0 service is an authentication service that requires two-step authentication only when the credit card company determines that the transaction is high-risk based on several factors.<br>
